 visual styles","src":"/recipe-thumbnails/four-directions.webp"},"userPromise":"See four genuinely different visual approaches to the same brief."},"x-presentation":{"initialView":"canvas","primaryControlIds":["brief","invariants"],"resultEmphasis":"hero","showPromptByDefault":false}}', 'prompt-canvas.prompt-workspace-template@2', 'sha256:7e30ee027c5f31df5510e094488cdbce86263323cf1b6104827c409b95a1c5bb', 'Create four genuinely different visual directions for {{brief}}. Hold {{invariants}} constant across all four. Make each direction distinct in composition, visual language, palette, lighting, and emotional tone rather than making minor parameter changes. Present four individually useful candidates.', NULL, '{"creator":"Prompt Canvas","kind":"first-party","promptUsage":"original","title":"Four creative directions"}', 'Initial official catalog publication.', '2026-09-03T00:00:00Z', '2026-09-03T00:00:00Z');
